#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Toffoli gate**\n"
msgstr "**Gate Toffoli**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Toffoli gate, also known as the double controlled-NOT gate (CCX), has two control qubits and one target. It applies a NOT to the target only when both controls are in state $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Gate Toffoli, juga dikenal sebagai gate double controlled-NOT (CCX), memiliki dua qubit kontrol dan satu target. Gate ini menerapkan NOT pada target hanya ketika kedua kontrol berada dalam keadaan $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Toffoli gate with the Hadamard gate is a universal gate set for quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "Gate Toffoli bersama gate Hadamard adalah himpunan gate universal untuk komputasi kuantum.\n"

