#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**RZ gate**\n"
msgstr "**Gate RZ**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The RZ gate implements $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}Z)$. On the Bloch sphere, this gate corresponds to rotating the qubit state around the z axis by the given angle.\n"
msgstr "Gate RZ mengimplementasikan $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}Z)$. Pada Bloch sphere, gate ini bersesuaian dengan memutar keadaan qubit di sekitar sumbu z sebesar sudut yang diberikan.\n"

