#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Non-unitary operators and modifiers {#non-unitary-operators-and-modifiers}"
msgstr "Operator non-unitary dan modifier {#non-unitary-operators-and-modifiers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Reset operation**\n"
msgstr "**Operasi Reset**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The reset operation returns a qubit to state $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$, irrespective of its state before the operation was applied. It is not a reversible operation.\n"
msgstr "Operasi reset mengembalikan qubit ke keadaan $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$, terlepas dari keadaannya sebelum operasi diterapkan. Operasi ini tidak dapat dibalik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                          | OpenQASM reference |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![0-opera](/docs/images/guides/composer/6a1605ff-fb88-4bf7-ac81-43b0cce918c9.avif) | `reset q[0];`      |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Referensi Composer                          | Referensi OpenQASM |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![0-opera](/docs/images/guides/composer/6a1605ff-fb88-4bf7-ac81-43b0cce918c9.avif) | `reset q[0];`      |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Measurement**\n"
msgstr "**Pengukuran**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Measurement in the standard basis, also known as the z basis or computational basis. Can be used to implement any kind of measurement when combined with gates. It is not a reversible operation.\n"
msgstr "Pengukuran dalam basis standar, juga dikenal sebagai basis z atau basis komputasi. Dapat digunakan untuk mengimplementasikan segala jenis pengukuran jika dikombinasikan dengan gate. Operasi ini tidak dapat dibalik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                                       | OpenQASM reference |\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![Measurement in the standard or z basis](/docs/images/guides/composer/9fca7f1e-ba46-400d-a3d1-312ee011d705.avif) | `measure q[0];`    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Referensi Composer                                       | Referensi OpenQASM |\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![Pengukuran dalam basis standar atau z](/docs/images/guides/composer/9fca7f1e-ba46-400d-a3d1-312ee011d705.avif) | `measure q[0];`    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Control modifier**\n"
msgstr "**Modifier control**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A control modifier yields a gate whose original operation is now contingent on the state of the control qubit. When the control is in the $|1\\rangle$ state, the target qubit(s) undergo the specified unitary evolution. In contrast, no operation is performed if the control is in the $|0\\rangle$ state. If the control is in a superposition state, then the resulting operation follows from linearity.\n"
msgstr "Modifier control menghasilkan gate yang operasi aslinya kini bergantung pada keadaan qubit kontrol. Ketika kontrol berada dalam keadaan $|1\\rangle$, qubit target mengalami evolusi unitary yang ditentukan. Sebaliknya, tidak ada operasi yang dilakukan jika kontrol berada dalam keadaan $|0\\rangle$. Jika kontrol berada dalam keadaan superposisi, maka operasi yang dihasilkan mengikuti linearitas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drag the control modifier to a gate in order to add a control to it. Dots will appear above and below the gate, on the qubit wires that can be targets that control; click one or more dots to assign the target to one or more qubits. You can also assign a control by right-clicking a gate.\n"
msgstr "Seret modifier control ke sebuah gate untuk menambahkan kontrol padanya. Titik-titik akan muncul di atas dan di bawah gate, pada wire qubit yang bisa menjadi target kontrol; klik satu atau lebih titik untuk menetapkan target ke satu atau lebih qubit. Kamu juga bisa menetapkan kontrol dengan mengklik kanan sebuah gate.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove a control, right-click the gate and select the option to remove control.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menghapus kontrol, klik kanan gate dan pilih opsi untuk menghapus kontrol.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                                          | OpenQASM reference |\n"
"| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![Control modifier](/docs/images/guides/composer/243c0fad-8236-4b03-a71a-bacaed4055c8.avif) | `c`                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Referensi Composer                                          | Referensi OpenQASM |\n"
"| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![Control modifier](/docs/images/guides/composer/243c0fad-8236-4b03-a71a-bacaed4055c8.avif) | `c`                |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Barrier operation**\n"
msgstr "**Operasi Barrier**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To make your quantum program more efficient, the compiler will try to combine gates. The barrier is an instruction to the compiler to prevent these combinations being made. Additionally, it is useful for visualizations.\n"
msgstr "Untuk membuat program kuantum kamu lebih efisien, kompiler akan mencoba menggabungkan gate. Barrier adalah instruksi untuk kompiler agar tidak membuat penggabungan tersebut. Selain itu, barrier juga berguna untuk visualisasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                               | OpenQASM reference |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![barrier](/docs/images/guides/composer/96cd10ae-e3cf-40ea-9ca7-49a2d68a8c07.avif) | `barrier q;`       |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Referensi Composer                               | Referensi OpenQASM |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------ |\n"
"| ![barrier](/docs/images/guides/composer/96cd10ae-e3cf-40ea-9ca7-49a2d68a8c07.avif) | `barrier q;`       |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hadamard gate {#hadamard-gate}"
msgstr "Gate Hadamard {#hadamard-gate}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**H gate**\n"
msgstr "**Gate H**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The H, or Hadamard, gate rotates the states $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ and $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ to $\\left|+\\right\\rangle$ and $\\left|-\\right\\rangle$, respectively. It is useful for making superpositions. If you have a universal gate set on a classical computer and add the Hadamard gate, it becomes a universal gate set on a quantum computer.\n"
msgstr "Gate H, atau Hadamard, memutar keadaan $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ dan $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ masing-masing menjadi $\\left|+\\right\\rangle$ dan $\\left|-\\right\\rangle$. Gate ini berguna untuk membuat superposisi. Jika kamu memiliki himpunan gate universal pada komputer klasik dan menambahkan gate Hadamard, itu menjadi himpunan gate universal pada komputer kuantum.\n"

