msgstr ""
"| Referensi Composer                                    | Referensi OpenQASM | Q-sphere | Catatan tentang representasi q-sphere                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n"
"| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
