#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**RX gate**\n"
msgstr "**Gate RX**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The RX gate implements $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}X)$. On the Bloch sphere, this gate corresponds to rotating the qubit state around the x axis by the given angle.\n"
msgstr "Gate RX mengimplementasikan $exp(-i\\frac{\\theta}{2}X)$. Pada Bloch sphere, gate ini bersesuaian dengan memutar keadaan qubit di sekitar sumbu x sebesar sudut yang diberikan.\n"

