#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**U gate**\n"
msgstr "**Gate U**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "*(Previously called the U3 gate)* The three parameters allow the construction of any single-qubit gate. Has a duration of one unit of gate time.\n"
msgstr "*(Sebelumnya disebut gate U3)* Tiga parameter memungkinkan konstruksi gate qubit tunggal apa pun. Memiliki durasi satu unit waktu gate.\n"

